"2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The author-hosted browser port rendering the shareware game; original Quake artwork remains credited to id Software.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/three-quake-claude-port.webp","alt","Quake’s shareware level rendered in the Three.js port, with a first-person weapon and the original status bar.","https://mrdoob.github.io/three-quake/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87],"Claude 模型 / 对话","links","相关资源",[93],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":94,"_25":95},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","创作者开发记录",[99],"evidence",{"_62":100,"_25":101,"_102":103},"查看作者的 AI 协助与原作署名","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake#credits","note","The maintainer distinguishes id Software’s original game from the Three.js port made with Claude assistance.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[108],{"_62":109,"_25":110,"_102":111},"查看完整浏览器移植项目","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake","Complete browser port, maps, runtime source and tests, with the shareware pak0.pak. Code is GPL-2.0; original Quake game data has separate terms and is not relicensed by the code license.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[117],{"_62":118,"_25":75,"_102":119},"Play Three Quake","Keyboard, mouse and a WebGL-capable browser. The included shareware data covers Episode 1; full-game content is separate.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[127],{"_62":128,"_25":129,"_102":-7},"查看移植署名与作者开发日志","https://github.com/mrdoob/three-quake#dev-log","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[134,135,136,137],"Open the browser build, start a new single-player game and test the movement and firing controls.","Read the creator’s port credits and dev log alongside the original id Software source reference.","Inspect the browser renderer, game runtime, maps and tests to trace how the existing game was adapted.","Use the included shareware data for Episode 1; a registered full-game data set is separate and must be supplied by its owner.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Mr.doob 将 Claude 列为 Three.js 移植工作的协助者。Quake 的原始设计与实现来自 id Software，本例是 AI 辅助移植，不能表述成 AI 创作了 Quake。README 链接开发记录，但没有明确具体 Claude 客户端。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js · JavaScript","engine","lead","3d",[134,135,136,137],{"_62":167,"_25":129,"_17":123},{"_62":118,"_25":75,"_17":113,"_102":119},{"_62":164,"_25":110,"_102":111,"_165":166},{"_62":163,"_25":101,"_102":103},[162],"ai-assisted","threejs","Read the author’s AI and original-game credits","Open the complete browser port","scope","complete-project","Read the port credits and creator dev log",{"_169":170},"documents",{"_67":171,"_35":172},[174,178,179,180,177,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,176,213,175,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234],[173,174,175,176,177],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","